WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:09.423
Layla runs operations at a fast-growing company in Cairo. She knows exactly which tool her team needs.

2
00:00:10.242 --> 00:00:16.633
But like every business idea, it waits in line. Developers, budgets, months.

3
00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:21.998
That's the problem Nine was built to solve, in three phases.

4
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:32.157
Phase one: we build real products for problems we know, like Nine Marketing and Nine Recruitment. Every one of them is built by our own engine.

5
00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:43.652
Phase two: we open that engine to the market as nin9 Dev. Business people like Layla describe what they need, and build real products themselves, with no development team.

6
00:00:45.075 --> 00:00:52.442
Phase three: Nine becomes a studio. We keep launching companies, and young entrepreneurs like Omar run them.

7
00:00:53.075 --> 00:00:57.795
Their profits fund Cpinoffs: companies that give back to the community.

8
00:00:59.617 --> 00:01:08.563
And every product opens the market for the next. Nine Marketing markets every Nine company. Nine Recruitment finds the people to run them.

9
00:01:09.742 --> 00:01:15.228
Real problems. Real products. One engine. Build it with us.
